menu "Link key"

    config WFB_KEY_FILE
        string "Key file, relative to the repo root"
        default "keys/drone.key"
        help
            A wfb_keygen key file of 64 bytes. The camera uses drone.key and the base station gs.key.
            The default is the repo's test key from the password "change-me": anyone with the repo
            can read and inject into the link. For anything beyond desk tests, run ./ipc keys: your
            own pair in keys/own/ (never committed) then replaces the test keys in every build.

endmenu
